      "text": "GUIDED RESPONSE\n\n1. Collect objective signals\n\n2. Review error-budget trend\n\n3. Identify dominant contributors\n\n4. Prioritize improvement work",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
